{
    "key": "services-emergency",
    "templateKey": "repobot-services-emergency",
    "title": "Plumber & emergency services",
    "description": "A 24/7 dispatch-trade site: the call leads everywhere, a response-time metrics strip proves the promise, services carry flat printed prices, and a service-request form covers everything that can wait until morning \u2014 a multi-page site edited in one content file.",
    "marketingExampleTitle": "Emergency service business",
    "category": "services",
    "homePath": "/",
    "previewPath": "/emergency",
    "homeViewDir": "web/app/src/View/ServicesEmergency",
    "base": "landing",
    "clientOnly": true,
    "capabilities": ["IOS", "ANDROID"],
    "isDefault": false,
    "forms": {
        "$comment": "Managed-form kinds, formKey -> kind (append-only vocabulary: RSVP | LEAD | MAILING_LIST | PROOFING). Compose stamps these into repobot.deploy.json as formKinds; the dashboard renders declared kinds as typed views and keeps the raw Inbox for undeclared keys.",
        "service-request": "LEAD"
    },
    "theme": {
        "$comment": "The dispatch trade's brand overlay on the sitework register: utility blue over the plan-grid ground instead of the register's native safety orange \u2014 same trades voice as the category's contractor starter, visibly its own company. Marketing pages resolve brand over preset accent, so the overlay re-skins the pages and the app surfaces together.",
        "brand": { "primary": "#1d4ed8", "primaryDark": "#7aa7ff" }
    },
    "contentContract": {
        "$comment": "The pack's content slots, as data (packs/README.md 'Content contract'). Declares what a composer (agent or tool) must bind for a generated variant of this pack to present as real: slot paths into the typed content module, their kinds, and minimums. The demo business is a plumber, but the slots are trade-agnostic \u2014 an electrician, HVAC, locksmith, or towing variant binds the same shape. Authored alongside the module and guarded by the pack's content tests \u2014 the module satisfies the contract; the contract never drifts ahead of it.",
        "module": "web/app/src/View/ServicesEmergency/content.ts",
        "slots": {
            "business.name": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.tagline": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.location": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.phone": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.email": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.address": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.license": { "kind": "text" },
            "dispatchBadge": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.subheadline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.heroImage": { "kind": "media" },
            "services": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "eyebrow": { "kind": "text" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" },
                    "priceNote": { "kind": "text" },
                    "image": { "kind": "media" }
                }
            },
            "metrics": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "value": { "kind": "text" },
                    "label": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "steps.items": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "testimonials": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "quote": { "kind": "text" },
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "detail": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "serviceArea": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 1 },
            "faq": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "question": { "kind": "text" },
                    "answer": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "about.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "about.photo": { "kind": "media" },
            "about.paragraphs": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 2 },
            "about.credentials": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 1 },
            "request.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "request.body": { "kind": "text" }
        }
    },
    "landing": {
        "$comment": "Doc-aware pack pages: routes maps each pack route to the page id its config merges under (web/app/src/View/ServicesEmergency/ServicesEmergencyPage.tsx, useSitePageConfig). pages seeds each page's layout skeleton \u2014 ids match servicesEmergencyLanding.ts; the platform's structural editor edits these. The preset is sitework (the trades register) with the catalog's utility-blue brand overlay \u2014 the services category's shared voice, re-branded per company.",
        "style": { "preset": "sitework" },
        "routes": {
            "/": "home",
            "/services": "services",
            "/about": "about",
            "/request": "request"
        },
        "pages": {
            "home": {
                "sections": [
                    {
                        "id": "hero",
                        "type": "hero",
                        "variant": "split-media"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "dispatch-proof",
                        "type": "social-proof",
                        "variant": "metrics-row"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "services",
                        "type": "card-grid",
                        "variant": "3up"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "when-you-call",
                        "type": "steps",
                        "variant": "numbered-cards"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "kind-words",
                        "type": "testimonials",
                        "variant": "single-featured"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "service-area",
                        "type": "social-proof",
                        "variant": "text-logos"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "call-banner",
                        "type": "cta-banner"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "services": {
                "sections": [
                    {
                        "id": "hero",
                        "type": "hero",
                        "variant": "statement"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "services",
                        "type": "showcase",
                        "variant": "card-grid"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "faq",
                        "type": "faq"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "call-banner",
                        "type": "cta-banner"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "about": {
                "sections": [
                    {
                        "id": "story",
                        "type": "content-split",
                        "variant": "media-left"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "credentials",
                        "type": "social-proof",
                        "variant": "text-logos"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "kind-words",
                        "type": "testimonials",
                        "variant": "quote-grid"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "call-banner",
                        "type": "cta-banner"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "request": {
                "sections": [
                    {
                        "id": "hero",
                        "type": "hero",
                        "variant": "statement"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "request-form",
                        "type": "lead-form",
                        "variant": "detail-form"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    }
}
